## Scenarios

### Basic Support (`scenarios/basic-support.scenario.yaml`)
Tests fundamental support interactions like greetings and login help.

### Product Inquiry (`scenarios/product-inquiry.scenario.yaml`)
Tests how the agent handles product questions{{if .include_tools}} using knowledge base search{{end}}.

### Complaint Handling (`scenarios/complaint-handling.scenario.yaml`)
Tests empathy and problem-solving with upset customers{{if .include_tools}}, including order status checks{{end}}.

## Customization

### Adding New Scenarios

Create a new `*.scenario.yaml` file in `scenarios/`, add it to `config.arena.yaml`, following this structure:

```yaml
# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://promptkit.altairalabs.ai/schemas/v1alpha1/scenario.json
apiVersion: promptkit.altairalabs.ai/v1alpha1
kind: Scenario
metadata:
  name: your-scenario

spec:
  id: your-scenario-id
  task_type: support
  description: "Your scenario description"
  
  turns:
    - role: user
      content: "Customer message"
      assertions:
        - type: min_length
          params:
            min: 1
```

### Modifying the Support Agent

Edit `prompts/support-agent.prompt.yaml` to adjust:
- Tone and personality
- Specific guidelines
- Domain knowledge
- Escalation criteria

## Running Tests

```bash
# Run all scenarios
promptarena run

# Run specific scenario
promptarena run --scenario basic-support

# Run with specific provider
promptarena run --provider {{index .providers 0}}

# Generate Markdown report
promptarena run --format markdown
```

## Results

Test results are saved to `out/`:
- `index.json` and one JSON file per run - Detailed test results
- `results.md` - Markdown report

